        // Since constructor doesn't set owner, we need to initialize it through a pranked call
        // But transferOwnership is onlyOwner, so we must first set owner as the deployer (this contract) or work around it.
        // Actually, we have no setter for owner in constructor. We must use prank to set it.
        // First, set the owner by calling transferOwnership as the deployer (since deployer can set it? No, deployer is this contract, but owner is 0 initially).
